<title>JAPAN: Kato Spring Works - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kato Spring Works - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.27		vs	    8.04</p>
<p> Operating	  360    million	  vs	  233    million</p>
<p> Current	    271    million	  vs	   57    million</p>
<p> Net		   84    million	  vs	   25    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.21 yen	  vs	    0.66 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     38 million	  vs	  38 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  0.00 yen	  vs	    0.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kato Spring Works Co Ltd is a leading maker of precision springs for home electrical appliances, precision machines and business machines.</p>
